{"id":5883,"date":"2021-04-06T01:58:13","date_gmt":"2021-04-06T01:58:13","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.jammindjs.net\/?p=5883"},"modified":"2021-04-06T01:58:13","modified_gmt":"2021-04-06T01:58:13","slug":"5-reasons-to-hire-a-professional-event-planner","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"https:\/\/www.jammindjs.net\/atlanta-dj\/5-reasons-to-hire-a-professional-event-planner\/","title":{"rendered":"5 Reasons to Hire a Professional Event Planner"},"content":{"rendered":"<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"aligncenter size-full wp-image-5884 no-wp-caption\" src=\"https:\/\/jammindjs.net\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/04\/5-Reasons-to-Hire-a-Professional-Event-Planner-606bbfc4e2108.png\" alt=\" Benefits of Hiring Professional Event Planning Services\" width=\"621\" height=\"411\" srcset=\"https:\/\/www.jammindjs.net\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/04\/5-Reasons-to-Hire-a-Professional-Event-Planner-606bbfc4e2108.png 621w, https:\/\/www.jammindjs.net\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/04\/5-Reasons-to-Hire-a-Professional-Event-Planner-606bbfc4e2108-300x199.png 300w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 621px) 100vw, 621px\" \/><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Are you planning to throw a social event for your friends, family, or colleagues? Like most people, you\u2019re probably planning to do everything yourself to save money instead of hiring a <\/span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">professional event planner<\/span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">. You might think that you\u2019re avoiding an unnecessary expense, but it\u2019s the opposite.\u00a0<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Professional event planning services<\/span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> have connections and perks you might not have, and you\u2019ll end up not only spending more money but accumulating all the management-related stress upon yourself.\u00a0<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Read on to learn why hiring event planning professionals is a better idea!<\/span><\/p>\n<h1><b>Benefits of Hiring Professional Event Planning Services<\/b><\/h1>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Here are 5 reasons why you should <\/span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">hire a professional event planner<\/span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">:<\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<ul>\n<li aria-level=\"1\">\n<h2><b>Professional Event Planners have their Own Supply Chain Network<\/b><\/h2>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Professional event planners<\/span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> have a network of vendors and suppliers they regularly deal with. If you plan an event yourself, you\u2019ll most likely hire different services for catering, decoration, and entertainment, and pay them separately. Since professionals deal with vendors and suppliers every day, they often get better prices and deals you might not get.\u00a0<\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<ul>\n<li aria-level=\"1\">\n<h2><b>Save Time, Stress, and Money<\/b><\/h2>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Hiring professionals for event planning and management allows you to set a proper budget according to your requirement. Sure, you can do all the leg work yourself, but scouting takes time, especially if you don\u2019t know what you\u2019re looking for. So, save yourself the trouble and eliminate your stress.\u00a0<\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<ul>\n<li aria-level=\"1\">\n<h2><b>Create the Desired Ambiance<\/b><\/h2>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Professionals know how to create the perfect ambiance for your event with the right lighting, scenery, and presentation. You can also share with them your desired theme and mood settings, and they will bring your imagination to life.\u00a0<\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<ul>\n<li aria-level=\"1\">\n<h2><b>Enjoy Your Event<\/b><\/h2>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">What\u2019s the point of throwing a party if you won\u2019t be in it most of the time? It\u2019s better to give the responsibility of managing your social event to a professional event planning service. This way, you don\u2019t have to worry about anything and enjoy yourself. You can spend more time with your guests, eat and drink with your buddies, and enjoy all the festivities at your event.\u00a0<\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<ul>\n<li aria-level=\"1\">\n<h2><b>Packaged Pricing<\/b><\/h2>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">As mentioned earlier, event planners handle multiple events at a time. So, they have a chain of suppliers and vendors at their disposal. By hiring a professional event planner, you can get a packaged pricing on everything you need, from catering to entertainment from a single source. This way, you don\u2019t have to hire separate services for your event and pay more.<\/span><\/p>\n<h1>\n<b>Looking for a <\/b><b>Professional Event Planner<\/b><b>?<\/b><br \/>\n<\/h1>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">If you\u2019re looking to throw a party in Denver, Atlanta, Detroit, and surrounding areas, we highly recommend the event planning and management services of <\/span><a href=\"http:\/\/www.myjammindjs.com\/\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Jammin\u2019DJs<\/span><\/a><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">.<\/span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> With over 15 years in the business, we have the experience to go beyond meeting your requirement and take your social event to a whole new level.\u00a0<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">For more information, feel free to contact our team anytime!<\/span><\/p>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>Are you planning to throw a social event for your friends, family, or colleagues? Like most people, you\u2019re probably planning to do everything yourself to save money instead of hiring a professional event planner. You might think that you\u2019re avoiding an unnecessar